WrapCut PRO® precision edge cutting tape is a 4mm tackier and slightly stiffer adhesive tape with an exceptionally strong fine filament attached to the adhesive side at the very edge of the tape.

The higher tack and slight stiffness makes it easy to create long straight lines on vehicle body sides.

The fine filament becomes a cutting tool when pulled outward through the film of material that's been applied on top of the edge cutting tape.

Used to make precise trim lines through self-adhesive coloured and printed vinyl.

WrapCut® ensures you get precision cutting every time.

Prices shown are per 4mm x 45m roll

